{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2022-08-25 07:00:00', 'title': 'HYLIION ACQUIRES REVOLUTIONARY HYDROGEN AND FUEL AGNOSTIC GENERATOR TECHNOLOGY FROM GE', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HYLIION HOLDINGS CORP. (NYSE: HYLN) (“HYLIION”), A LEADER IN ELECTRIFIED POWERTRAIN SOLUTIONS FOR CLASS 8 SEMI-TRUCKS, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE A NEW HYDROGEN AND FUEL AGNOSTIC CAPABLE GENERATOR (“KARNO”) FROM GE ADDITIVE – PART OF GE (NYSE: GE) – A WORLD LEADER IN METAL ADDITIVE TECHNOLOGIES AND MANUFACTURING. “SOLVING CLIMATE CHANGE, WHETHER THROUGH ADOPTING ELECTRIC VEHICLES OR REDUCING EMISSIONS FROM MANUFACTURING'}{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2022-08-25 05:30:00', 'title': 'GE TO UNVEIL GRID TECHNOLOGY INNOVATIONS AT CIGRE 2022', 'text': 'PARIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #GEGRID--GE TO UNVEIL GRID TECHNOLOGY INNOVATIONS AT CIGRE 2022, ADDRESSING CHALLENGES OF GRID MODERNIZATION, DECARBONIZATION, DIGITIZATION & ELECTRIFICATION.'}